        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jester Party</strong> is an exciting 2–6 player co-op card game that blends horror and suspense.<br>Your goal is simple: <strong>play your cards silently in ascending order</strong> and trust your instincts completely — no turn order! Cooperate with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! If any player holds a card lower than the one on the table, <strong>you lose a life</strong>. Wrong moves throw the table into chaos, trigger terrifying events, and turn the party into a nightmare. You can also punish the player who makes a wrong move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–6 players</strong> play their cards without following a set turn order, relying solely on intuition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascending Rule</strong> applies: each new card must be higher than the previous one.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hints</strong>: Talking, signaling your next move, or giving advice is strictly forbidden.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong moves can lead to <strong>life loss or cursed penalties</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play all cards correctly, you advance to the next level at the end of the round.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>12 terrifying levels</strong>, each with more cards and higher risks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 <strong>Why Play?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Modes:</strong> You can scare the player who endangers the team by playing a wrong card, or play without any horror elements… and much more. Choose the mode you want.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Cooperation:</strong> Work seamlessly with your team, relying solely on your instincts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror &amp; Suspense:</strong> Wrong moves unleash eerie animations and sound effects that keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Fun:</strong> Experience a creepy yet hilarious jester-themed party.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
